    <item rdf:about="http://urmp.org/download/start?rev=1241066295&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2009-04-30T00:38:15-04:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>RIk Faith</dc:creator>
        <title>download:start</title>
        <link>http://urmp.org/download/start?rev=1241066295&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>urmp is currently in beta testing and development is not yet feature complete.

urmp opens all .mp3 files read-only and write only to files under ~/.urmp, or to the directoy specified using the -c or --config options.  However, this is untested software and should not be used except by beta testers.</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="http://urmp.org/docs?rev=1241065194&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2009-04-30T00:19:54-04:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>RIk Faith</dc:creator>
        <title>docs</title>
        <link>http://urmp.org/docs?rev=1241065194&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Building
./bootstrap
./configure
make
Required Packages


To build, it may be necessary to install additional software:
apt-get install autoconf automake pkg-config libtool
apt-get install libgtk2.0-dev
apt-get install libpcre3-dev

urmp will not build on an Ubuntu 7.10 (Gutsy Gibbon), or earlier, system.</description>
    </item>
    <item rdf:about="http://urmp.org/screen/start?rev=1241057301&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2009-04-29T22:08:21-04:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>RIk Faith</dc:creator>
        <title>screen:start</title>
        <link>http://urmp.org/screen/start?rev=1241057301&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>On the left, is the full database with incremental search.

On the bottom right is the current playlist.  A ~ before the rate means VBR.

On the top right is information about the song being played, and some controls for that song and the playlist.</description>
    </item>
